## Design System

From `.claude/skills/design-system.md`:

### Colors
- Primary: `#0A0A0A` (Ink Black)
- Surface: `#F5F5F0` (Warm Off-White), `#FFFFFF` (Pure White)
- Accent: `#6B7CFF` (Electric Indigo)
- Success: `#22C55E` | Warning: `#F59E0B` | Error: `#EF4444` | Info: `#3B82F6`
- Text Primary: `#0A0A0A` | Secondary: `#6B7280` | Muted: `#9CA3AF`
- Border: `#E5E7EB` (default), `#D1D5DB` (strong), `#6B7CFF` (focus)

### Typography
- Headings: Manrope 600/700
- Body: Instrument Sans 400/500
- Data/Code: IBM Plex Mono 400/500

### Spacing (8pt grid)
`4px · 8px · 12px · 16px · 20px · 24px · 32px · 40px · 48px · 64px`

### Border Radius
`sm: 4px · md: 8px · lg: 12px · xl: 16px · full: 9999px`

---

## File Organization

```
apps/api/
  src/
    routes/       ← request handling only (thin)
    services/     ← business logic
    repositories/ ← data access
    domain/       ← entities, value objects
    middleware/   ← auth, validation, logging
    jobs/         ← background job definitions

apps/web/
  src/
    pages/        ← route-level components
    components/   ← reusable UI components
    hooks/        ← custom React/Vue hooks
    lib/          ← API client, utilities
    store/        ← global state
```

---

## Git Conventions

```
feat(scope): add candidate search endpoint
fix(auth): resolve session expiry edge case
chore(deps): upgrade TypeScript to 5.4
docs(api): update requisition endpoint reference
test(candidates): add bulk import edge cases
```

Branches: `feature/*`, `fix/*`, `chore/*` — always from `dev`

---

## AI Collaboration

When using Cursor AI with this codebase:
1. Reference the relevant `.claude/rules/` file for the area you're working on
2. Check `.claude/agents/` for specialized context (security, UX, QA, etc.)
3. Use `.claude/templates/` for structured outputs (BRD, ADR, API contracts)
4. Generated code goes to `_ai/drafts/` first — review before promoting to `apps/` or `packages/`
